1
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,320
Let me try

2
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,100
to see if I can walk.

3
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,400
There's only one bed in the room.

4
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,200
You take it.

5
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,160
What about you?

6
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:04,720
I'll make do with this chair.

7
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,720
That won't work.

8
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:07,600
Why don't

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,960
you sleep with me?

10
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,520
Do you expect me

11
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,000
to drag you over?

12
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:38,800
It has its own charm.

13
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,240
There are so many stars.

14
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,759
If only there were shooting stars.

15
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:45,220
Then we could make wishes.

16
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,440
What wish would you like to make?

17
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,280
Write it on a sky lantern.

18
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,080
When it flies up,

19
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,479
your wish will come true.

20
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,090
Where did you get it?

21
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,170
I asked Butler Li to prepare it.

22
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,920
But my handwriting is terrible.

23
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,480
It's all crooked.

24
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,680
Maybe my wish won't come true then.

25
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,039
It's okay.

26
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,820
I'll write it with you.

27
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,400
What do you want to write?

28
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,320
I want to write

29
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,600
to be together

30
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,560
for a long time.

31
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:45,720
[For Rent]

32
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,000
[Room for Rent]

33
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,060
[Rooms Available]

34
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,360
Forever.

35
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,560
Together forever.

36
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:59,160
Who said I want to be with you forever?

37
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:03,360
I want us to be together forever.

38
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:57,920
Weiyang.

39
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,120
Actually, I...

40
00:03:59,120 --> 00:03:59,800
Um...

41
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,320
You go first.

42
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,760
Xu.

43
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,880
I'm sorry.

44
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,680
My father...

45
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,440
You already know.

46
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,200
Because in the past,

47
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,040
there were too many suitors

48
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,000
pursuing me,

49
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,680
my father sent assassins

50
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,940
to frighten them away.

51
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,080
This time,

52
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,000
perhaps because

53
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,650
I stayed at the Princess's mansion

54
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:37,680
for too long because of you,

55
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:38,960
so

56
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,760
he came down hard on you.

57
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:42,800
I'm sorry.

58
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,200
Your father wants to kill me.

59
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,560
Do you really think that's the reason?

60
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,760
What else

61
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,240
could it possibly be?

62
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:56,120
Since the corrupt minister has discovered my identity,

63
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,720
we are bound to fight to the death in the future.

64
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,360
It's better for Weiyang to know the truth now,

65
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,560
so she can let go of any lingering hopes.

66
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,560
Weiyang.

67
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,120
Actually...

68
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,720
Actually what?

69
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,360
Nothing.

70
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,880
Xu.

71
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:30,040
You know you can tell me

72
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,240
anything directly.

73
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:37,130
We've known each other for so long,

74
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:39,720
yet all I know about you

75
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,800
is still limited to

76
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,760
just your name, Wei Shixu.

77
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,080
Sir,

78
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,400
we've already paid our taxes.

79
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,159
Here's the tax receipt.

80
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,220
Please take a look.

81
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:58,120
This is fake.

82
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:58,960
Either pay your taxes

83
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,920
or close your business.

84
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,920
Your choice.

85
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,500
How could this be fake?

86
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,960
Please look at it again.

87
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,560
Is there no justice anymore?

88
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,160
You want to talk about justice?

89
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,720
I'll take you away right now

90
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,680
and lock you up for half a year

91
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,720
to let you know

92
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,250
what justice really means.

93
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,440
Stop!

94
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,400
You didn't even look at it.

95
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,660
How can you prove his tax receipt is fake?

96
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,840
Let's do this.

97
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:27,000
I'll take it to my father to examine.

98
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,720
If it's really fake,

99
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,000
you can take him away.

100
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,200
But if you've wronged an innocent person...

101
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:33,360
I wouldn't dare,

102
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,200
Miss Jiang, please be merciful.

103
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,040
Thank you for your generous help,

104
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,800
may I ask

105
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,240
which family you're from?

106
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,000
I, Wei, will visit to express my gratitude another day.

107
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,800
My father is the Prime Minister,

108
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:56,570
and I am Jiang Weiyang, the only daughter of the Prime Minister.

109
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:58,820
Goodbye, no need to see me off.

110
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:01,920
How can you

111
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,200
be so rude?

112
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,680
I've helped many people.

113
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,680
They were all grateful to me.

114
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,400
Only you are different.

115
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,680
That day was my fault.

116
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,040
Your strangeness

117
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,120
aroused my curiosity,

118
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,660
so I wanted to know you better.

119
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:26,680
I wanted to know

120
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,210
what kind of person you are.

121
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,800
I discovered

122
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:33,080
you're nice to everyone

123
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,440
except me.

124
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:37,340
You're so distant.

125
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,200
So my understanding of you

126
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,720
still remains limited.

127
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,880
Xu.

128
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,400
I'm sorry.

129
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,160
Forever

130
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,880
together.

131
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,050
What did you say?

132
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:15,680
Xu,

133
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,680
look quickly.

134
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,560
What's that?

135
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,200
Forever together.

136
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:41,919
Don't bother me.

137
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:43,000
Nanny Qian is here.

138
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,280
Get up quickly.

139
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,000
Who's Nanny Qian?

140
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,400
Is she rich?

141
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,000
Nanny Qian doesn't have money.

142
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,640
But she has the City Lord's token.

143
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,460
Is your modeling this simple?

144
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:08,100
Using exactly the same face as the staff.

145
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:11,560
Not entirely.

146
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:13,040
When we did the modeling,

147
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,840
you and Zhou Mo weren't here yet.

148
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:16,680
What do you mean?

149
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,280
Are you saying

150
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:19,160
she wasn't originally in the game?

151
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,080
No, she wasn't.

152
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:26,520
I heard that recently,

153
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:29,160
someone was attacked in the woods outside town.

154
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:32,220
The City Lord is concerned about the Princess's safety

155
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:35,680
and has specially assigned the royal guard, Lady April,

156
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,240
to protect Your Highness.

157
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:38,960
April.

158
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,680
Greetings, Your Highness.

159
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:42,540
Greetings, Second Young Master.

160
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:45,160
It really is

161
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,920
exactly the same.

162
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,320
Very well,

163
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,160
Lady April.

164
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,920
Regarding Young Master Yun's matter,

165
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:01,480
the City Lord doesn't want to investigate further.

166
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,920
Between him and the First Young Master,

167
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,560
who stays and who goes.

168
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:08,480
Your Highness should make a decision soon.

169
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,680
This old servant

170
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:12,240
will take his leave now.

171
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:22,840
System.

172
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:25,200
System.

173
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:28,000
It seems players can't summon the system at will.

174
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,360
But logically, with new characters appearing,

175
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,290
the system should give some hints.

176
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,280
The system is truly useless

177
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,480
when you need it most.

178
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,200
System.

179
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,480
System.

180
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,280
Look quickly.

181
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,560
This woman looks

182
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:47,880
like trouble.

183
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,260
What are you doing?

184
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,330
Greetings, Your Highness.

185
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,760
Things have been unstable lately.

186
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,880
All letters in and out of the mansion

187
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,340
I must review personally.

188
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,000
Your Highness is well.

189
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:08,400
Please do not worry, Lord Governor.

190
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,520
It's for my mother.

191
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,600
Yes.

192
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,010
It seems to be a misunderstanding.

193
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,080
It's all right.

194
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,540
I'll go write another one.

195
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:21,560
I take my leave.

196
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:33,840
The original game didn't have a character named April.

197
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,720
But now

198
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,520
the system is in Zhou Mo's hands.

199
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:46,400
Mr. Mu,

200
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,040
it's after work hours

201
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:50,160
and you're still so concerned about Su Jinli.

202
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:51,200
You don't

203
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,200
still have feelings for her, do you?

204
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,400
She's my assistant.

205
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:56,690
It's normal to care about my assistant, isn't it?

206
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,280
I'll go get her for you.

207
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:59,000
No need.

208
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:01,440
I'll go myself.

209
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:05,960
Mr. Mu,

210
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,160
what are you doing?

211
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,360
Supervising the staff.

212
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:15,480
You suspect her?

213
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:29,720
Have some tea.

214
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:33,600
Is she really Zhou Mo or not?

215
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,560
They just look alike.

216
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,640
Don't overthink it.

217
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:39,600
Here.

218
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,860
Have something to eat.

219
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:43,640
Don't move!

220
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,400
Your Highness.

221
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,120
This person was acting suspiciously outside.

222
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,640
I've detained him for questioning.

223
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,900
But he refuses to reveal his intentions.

224
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,760
Most likely the Prime Minister's men.

225
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:54,320
They must be looking for Wei Shixu

226
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,560
and Miss Jiang.

227
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,920
Take him to the government office.

228
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:58,120
Keeping him in the Princess's mansion

229
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,080
might lead to trouble.

230
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,210
Yes, Your Highness.

231
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,720
The way she's positioned

232
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,600
looks deliberate no matter how you see it.

233
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:26,200
Are all women who look like this manipulative?

234
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,000
Are you all right?

235
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,440
Who exactly is

236
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,600
this young master?

237
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:39,570
Why is the Prime Minister so eager to find him?

238
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,920
Miss April,

239
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,520
why are you so concerned

240
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:44,960
about my young master?

241
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,200
It concerns His Highness's safety.

242
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:49,000
I must investigate thoroughly.

243
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:50,720
Since you were sent

244
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,720
by my mother to assist with the investigation,

245
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,720
I'll tell you.

246
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,640
Wei Shixu

247
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,800
is actually the surviving orphan of the Wei family.

248
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,680
Years ago, General Wei was framed by the Prime Minister.

249
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,240
His entire family was massacred,

250
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,680
leaving only a blood letter as evidence.

251
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,000
Now the Prime Minister

252
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,880
probably knows

253
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:07,400
Wei Shixu's true identity

254
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,530
and is searching for the blood letter.

255
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,000
I see.

256
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:13,640
No wonder the Prime Minister wants to eliminate him.

257
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,520
That blood letter

258
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,600
must be kept safe.

259
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,240
Don't worry.

260
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,640
The blood letter is in my room.

261
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:19,570
It won't be lost.

262
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,400
Then I

263
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,530
shall take my leave.

264
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,320
You scared me.

265
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,200
You just

266
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,800
deliberately revealed so much information

267
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,560
to test if April

268
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:53,440
would try to steal the blood letter?

269
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,320
Exactly.

270
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:56,320
If she's really suspicious,

271
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,880
then her target is the blood letter.

272
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,210
She'll show up tonight.

273
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,040
My wife is truly amazing.

274
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,200
With just one move,

275
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,160
she can test April's true intentions.

276
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,680
Who's your wife?

277
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,220
I'm just your girlfriend at most.

278
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,120
Then I'll only accompany my wife.

279
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:12,850
I'm leaving.

280
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,880
Since you're already here,

281
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:17,140
let's watch together.

282
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,200
Let's change position.
